审计 H4(25) HIGH：策略/成员/云平台统计卡标「总数」，实际由当前页 groups 聚合（分页下把页级和伪装成全局总数）。按审计短期方向标注（本页）；全量口径需后端统计接口另行排期。审计归档 85 项至此全部处置完毕。
---
 src/views/iam/groups/index.vue | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/views/iam/groups/index.vue b/src/views/iam/groups/index.vue
index 74d5ac7..3fada7a 100644
--- a/src/views/iam/groups/index.vue
+++ b/src/views/iam/groups/index.vue
@@ -41,7 +41,7 @@
         </div>
         <div class="stat-body">
           <div class="stat-value">{{ totalPolicies }}</div>
-          <div class="stat-label">策略总数</div>
+          <div class="stat-label">策略总数（本页）</div>
         </div>
       </div>
       <div class="stat-card">
@@ -50,7 +50,7 @@
         </div>
         <div class="stat-body">
           <div class="stat-value">{{ totalMembers }}</div>
-          <div class="stat-label">成员总数</div>
+          <div class="stat-label">成员总数（本页）</div>
         </div>
       </div>
       <div class="stat-card">
@@ -59,7 +59,7 @@
         </div>
         <div class="stat-body">
           <div class="stat-value">{{ platformCount }}</div>
-          <div class="stat-label">云平台</div>
+          <div class="stat-label">云平台（本页）</div>
         </div>
       </div>
     </div>
